229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (Existing approaches either optimize task allocation based on robot capabilities or focus on recovering from robot failures. Very few frameworks integrate both, resulting in inefficient task reassignment when failures occur.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
