<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 162 0 R
/T (Dependence on Centralized Coordination)
/E (Dependence on Centralized Coordination)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (Many capability-aware systems still rely on centralized or semi-centralized planners, creating computational bottlenecks and a single point of failure, limiting scalability in large warehouse robot fleets.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 162 0 R
