/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
233 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (Most studies only consider capability degradation or simple robot failures. Practical issues such as communication loss, battery depletion, sudden robot crashes, and dynamic task reallocation remain largely unaddressed.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
